{
  "title": "Nutty Silky Tunisian Fish Tagine",
  "description": "A sour, silky, and lazy-sunday friendly Tunisian dish featuring dark chocolate chips and sashimi-cut fish, made with ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly ingredients. This dish is perfect for a relaxing dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
